{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/2f22c7775247951ab4923180c56487e8.poster.avif?t=1758301007\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/2f22c7775247951ab4923180c56487e8.webm?t=1758301007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alchemy of the Earth</strong> is an open-world dreamscape where herbalism and alchemy are your lifelines. Gather rare ingredients, brew potions and poultices, and scavenge for loot to survive harsh nights while uncovering the secrets of the island\u2019s creator.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/80a23d64672cf0d1a72df312ff56b8f5.poster.avif?t=1758301007\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/80a23d64672cf0d1a72df312ff56b8f5.webm?t=1758301007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Explore a large hand-crafted world with distinct environments and sweeping vistas.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From open meadows to wind-shaped highlands, each biome is carefully built by hand to provide variety, clarity, and a sense of place. The landscapes are shaped to feel natural while guiding exploration, offering distinct scenery without breaking immersion. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/b608469dd990ea464cb55985396506fa.poster.avif?t=1758301007\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/b608469dd990ea464cb55985396506fa.webm?t=1758301007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> Find your way through the Veil:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through abandoned settlements, crumbling structures, and overgrown wilderness. Along the way, you\u2019ll uncover scattered traces of the island\u2019s past\u2014small details and forgotten places that piece together its history. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/db53b1b01cc91566da8ca1d86a5a80bf.poster.avif?t=1758301007\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/db53b1b01cc91566da8ca1d86a5a80bf.webm?t=1758301007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Pick every flower:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy of the Earth is the ultimate flower picking simulator. Navigate through dense forests and wide meadows with millions of harvestable ingredients, but don\u2019t pick them all by hand, progress your character and discover magic ways to gather resources.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/15ee38f9ffe1a9b9b0434345d0dc15f4.poster.avif?t=1758301007\" width=640 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/15ee38f9ffe1a9b9b0434345d0dc15f4.webm?t=1758301007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/15ee38f9ffe1a9b9b0434345d0dc15f4.mp4?t=1758301007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Grind ingredients, brew potions, distill magic:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hundreds of distinct ingredients, items, poultices, and potions to discover the power of the elements is in your hands. Use your knowledge of aspects and essences to craft dozens of unique potions and spells to survive the creator\u2019s failed experiments.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/c85a2792b3347873439b654659a025d3.poster.avif?t=1758301007\" width=640 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/c85a2792b3347873439b654659a025d3.webm?t=1758301007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/extras/c85a2792b3347873439b654659a025d3.mp4?t=1758301007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Full Narration and soundtrack:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the story of Alchemy of the Earth through over 50 audio narrations and 80 minutes of original music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for taking a look at Alchemy of the Earth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2788430?t=1758301007","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758301007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758301007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2788430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758301007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save 